First apotome of a medial,\vspace*{-7pt}

Second apotome of a medial,\vspace*{-7pt}

Minor,\vspace*{-7pt}

That which with a rational (area) produces a medial whole,\vspace*{-7pt}

That which with a medial (area) produces a medial whole.}
